---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { SUPPORT_EMAIL } from '../data/downloads'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use — BP Analyst"
  description="Draft terms of use for BP Analyst. For qualified counsel review."
>
  <article class="legal">
    <header class="legal__header">
      <p class="legal__eyebrow">Legal draft</p>
      <h1 class="legal__title">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="legal__lede">
        <strong>Draft for qualified legal counsel review</strong> — not a final
        counsel-approved contract. Last updated 6 November 2026.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="legal__body">
      <section>
        <h2>The service</h2>
        <p>
          BP Analyst is a free browser extension and marketing site provided by
          Ilya Titov. It helps you analyse Beatport list pages you open in your
          browser. It is provided “as is” without warranties to the fullest
          extent permitted by law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>No affiliation</h2>
        <p>
          BP Analyst is an independent project. It is not affiliated with,
          endorsed by, or sponsored by Beatport or The Beatport Group LLC.
          Beatport® and related marks belong to their owners. You must comply
          with Beatport’s own terms when using Beatport.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>
          Use the extension only on pages you are allowed to access. Do not use
          it to attack, overload, or circumvent Beatport’s security. CSV exports
          and reports are for your personal analysis; you are responsible for
          any further sharing and for respecting third-party rights (including
          Beatport Content and trademark rules).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          See the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and
          <a href="/cookies">Cookie Notice</a> drafts.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Donations</h2>
        <p>
          Optional support links may point to an external page. Donations are
          voluntary, not a purchase of the extension, and do not create a paid
          support contract unless separately agreed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, the author is not
          liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from use of the
          extension or site. Mandatory consumer rights in your country of
          residence remain unaffected where they cannot be waived.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  @layer components {
    .legal {
      display: grid;
      gap: var(--space-8);
      padding-block: calc(5.5rem + var(--space-7)) var(--space-9);
      max-inline-size: 42rem;
    }

    .legal__eyebrow {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--color-fg-subtle);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .legal__title {
      margin: var(--space-2) 0 0;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .legal__lede {
      margin: var(--space-4) 0 0;
      color: var(--color-fg-muted);
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .legal__body {
      display: grid;
      gap: var(--space-7);
    }

    .legal__body h2 {
      margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: var(--text-xl);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .legal__body p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--color-fg-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .legal__body a {
      color: var(--color-accent);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
    }
  }
</style>
